BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Black holes: tides (a review clip)</h1>
A delta-glider lowered towards a black hole of 10 solar masses (spin 0.7), the damage model on, by script
(Script/Tests/TidesVideo): heard from its cockpit as the tides build - creaks, groans,
its parts tearing off - then seen from outside as it breaks up.
END_HYPERDESC

